 Sherbet may refer to:
## Sorbet | https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sorbet 
 Sorbet (, ) is a frozen dessert made using ice combined with fruit juice, fruit purée, or other ingredients, such as wine, liqueur, or honey.
## Rocky road (ice cream) | https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rocky_road_(ice_cream) 
 Rocky road ice cream is a chocolate-flavored ice cream. Though there are variations from the original flavor, it traditionally comprises chocolate ice cream, nuts, and whole or diced marshmallows.
